Third-party files distributed with this repository keep their own licences.

`packages/core/grammars/` holds four tree-sitter grammars built by their own
maintainers, each under the MIT licence, with the licence text alongside them in
`packages/core/grammars/licenses/`. `packages/core/grammars/README.md` records
where each file came from, at which version and commit, and its SHA-256.

Dependencies installed from npm are not part of this repository and are governed
by their own licences.
